/-!
# Short-word witnesses for the packed Fi₂₃ actions

The five auxiliary permutations and their inverse tables act on the 31671
source labels. Further tables witness an addition chain for the thirtieth
power and a chain for the sixth power. These definitions assert no agreement
with the ambient words; that is the separate short-word certificate obligation.
`Numerical` checks the source-label compositions, while `Reduction` connects
them to the exact evaluators in `WordEvaluation`.

Source: the retained ATLAS F24G1-p306936B0 tables, the exact `WordSetup`
words, and the shared `Comparison.Data.labelMap`. Reproduce with
`source/generate.py`. The encoder is original CFSG code under Apache 2.0;
original ATLAS attribution and data rights remain in `AtlasCarriers/source/`.
-/

@[expose] public section
namespace Sporadic.Fischer.Fi24Prime.Fi23Lift.Certificate.Ambient.WordChecks

/-- A packed source-label witness, with a total finite codomain. -/
def sourceMap (t : PackedBlocks) (i : Fin 31671) : Fin 31671 :=
  ⟨lookup t.get 15 i.val % 31671, Nat.mod_lt _ (by decide)⟩

